{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858810/extras/782eb0d45ddc7bdc470b778a46adfaa0.avif?t=1756104836\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Jump into the SEMO's Great Adventure right now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, in the world of figures, a square tries to create order by locking up freewheeling circles. SEMO, Circle's friend, joins forces to rescue them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEMO is a four-player hardcore co-op game in which you move your triangle horizontally and jump to hit the circle to get it to the target point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Various stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many stages that will make you suffer, and they will be added in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Single and multiplayer modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy all the content by yourself, even if you don't have friends, as well as remote play with friends. You can also enjoy it with two people on one device without an Internet connection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Competitive mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only PVE, but you can also compete with your opponent in a PVP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Map Editor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testing is currently in place, and we are developing a space to unleash your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- The highest record</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is graded based on how efficiently you cleared quickly. Win your fight against yourself and break the shortest record!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3858810?t=1756104836","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3858810?t=1756104836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858810/9d7333a415d07bc0cbd8c3a6d22189830292946e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756104836","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858810/9d7333a415d07bc0cbd8c3a6d22189830292946e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756104836","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858810/extras/782eb0d45ddc7bdc470b778a46adfaa0.avif?t=1756104836\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Jump into the SEMO's Great Adventure right now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, in the world of figures, a square tries to create order by locking up freewheeling circles. SEMO, Circle's friend, joins forces to rescue them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEMO is a four-player hardcore co-op game in which you move your triangle horizontally and jump to hit the circle to get it to the target point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Various stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many stages that will make you suffer, and they will be added in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Single and multiplayer modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy all the content by yourself, even if you don't have friends, as well as remote play with friends. You can also enjoy it with two people on one device without an Internet connection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Competitive mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only PVE, but you can also compete with your opponent in a PVP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Map Editor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testing is currently in place, and we are developing a space to unleash your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- The highest record</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is graded based on how efficiently you cleared quickly. Win your fight against yourself and break the shortest record!</p>","developers":["Hard Coders"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858810/390cf3d30fa030c2a1eedd22c466a380ae260674/header.jpg?t=1756104836","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257169924,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169924/movie480.mp4?t=1752869971","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169924/movie_max.mp4?t=1752869971"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257169924/4b1a08a64bb350cc4c1b55cef13e8b964feb7ef3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752869971","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169924/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752869971","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169924/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752869971"}}],"name":"SEMO","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Proc